[h2]Version 1.1.0[/h2]

[b]Updates[/b]
[list]
[*]Updated for AGOT 0.5.2.1, including its new governments (Norvos and the Lorathi Principality), landed knights and Dragonstone titles.
[*]Freehold families' house power is now based on their Merit rank instead of their influence.
[*]Secrets of the Higher Mysteries is now fully optional: magister checks only apply when it is loaded.
[/list]

[b]Fixes[/b]
[list]
[*]Freehold rulers now get the regular lifestyle perk bonuses, the same as AGOT's other governments.
[*]Freehold rulers can now use accolades.
[*]Barons under a Freehold no longer take the Freehold government.
[*]Dragon Keeps now follow the Estate rules when moving: they cannot leave the realm, move during a war involving either location, or move to where they already are.
[*]Removed outdated copies of the imperial and local examination activities.
[*]Fixed an AI interaction behaviour in the Freehold interactions.
[/list]
